{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three mystics are leaving the Last shelter of humanity and entering demon-held lands, claimed through centuries of war. Guide them through challenging combat using diverse tactical approaches. Explore harsh regions in search of ancient relics, supplies, ingredients, and rare armor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Round structure. Combat rounds have two phases: Planning and Resolution. During Planning, each unit plans an action; during Resolution, those actions unfold - and the battlefield becomes alive with screeching blades, blood and fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/f5bbfe2d4a57fca296129211f24ba62a.poster.avif?t=1766651664\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/f5bbfe2d4a57fca296129211f24ba62a.webm?t=1766651664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/f5bbfe2d4a57fca296129211f24ba62a.mp4?t=1766651664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understanding the situation. Knowing your enemies\u2019 next move is key to effective fighting. Force them to plan before you, so you catch a glimpse of your enemies\u2019 intent. Or study them to know their future moves - each enemy type follows its own logic, based on the flow of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torments. Units can enter one of three Torment states - Dread, Fury, or Madness - each limiting available planning actions. Use special actions to exert mental influence on your enemies to disrupt their strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels. Story-driven journey triggers hybrid level generation, with each terrain shaped by distinct logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path. You will choose your path under harsh conditions: growing fatigue, limited supplies for recovery, enemies all around - and the unknown ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/1ac03bbe310f61c945bf11b271d89044.poster.avif?t=1766651664\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/1ac03bbe310f61c945bf11b271d89044.webm?t=1766651664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/1ac03bbe310f61c945bf11b271d89044.mp4?t=1766651664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fatigue and rest. Party fatigue grows with every step, weakening your mystics in combat. Search for supplies and set up camps to reduce fatigue, heal, and recover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters &amp; Builds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Demonologist, the Exorcist, and the Witch unite to face the dangers of the Shrouded Lands - though each has their own reason for leaving humanity\u2019s last shelter.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/210284eccfd24d2e3532b60786427760.avif?t=1766651664\" width=620 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor. Although you control only three characters, the Armor-Skill system allows for diverse builds and flexible strategies. Each character can equip different armor, which defines their appearance and available skills - but their core stats are not affected by changing armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/f5265735355ec59263ed829e9ac6386d.poster.avif?t=1766651664\" width=620 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/f5265735355ec59263ed829e9ac6386d.webm?t=1766651664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/f5265735355ec59263ed829e9ac6386d.mp4?t=1766651664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill. Each time a skill is used, it boosts the character\u2019s core stats. These stats determine how skills from different armors can be upgraded, with multiple upgrade options available for each.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743600?t=1766651664","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743600?t=1766651664","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/35c412a409f51199667c5ae73e551acb4e892089/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766651664","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/35c412a409f51199667c5ae73e551acb4e892089/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766651664","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game features stylized scenes of blood, violence, injuries, implied partial nudity, and mild profanity in dialogue."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three mystics are leaving the Last shelter of humanity and entering demon-held lands, claimed through centuries of war. Guide them through challenging combat using diverse tactical approaches. Explore harsh regions in search of ancient relics, supplies, ingredients, and rare armor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Round structure. Combat rounds have two phases: Planning and Resolution. During Planning, each unit plans an action; during Resolution, those actions unfold - and the battlefield becomes alive with screeching blades, blood and fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/f5bbfe2d4a57fca296129211f24ba62a.poster.avif?t=1766651664\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/f5bbfe2d4a57fca296129211f24ba62a.webm?t=1766651664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/f5bbfe2d4a57fca296129211f24ba62a.mp4?t=1766651664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understanding the situation. Knowing your enemies\u2019 next move is key to effective fighting. Force them to plan before you, so you catch a glimpse of your enemies\u2019 intent. Or study them to know their future moves - each enemy type follows its own logic, based on the flow of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torments. Units can enter one of three Torment states - Dread, Fury, or Madness - each limiting available planning actions. Use special actions to exert mental influence on your enemies to disrupt their strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels. Story-driven journey triggers hybrid level generation, with each terrain shaped by distinct logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path. You will choose your path under harsh conditions: growing fatigue, limited supplies for recovery, enemies all around - and the unknown ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/1ac03bbe310f61c945bf11b271d89044.poster.avif?t=1766651664\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/1ac03bbe310f61c945bf11b271d89044.webm?t=1766651664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/1ac03bbe310f61c945bf11b271d89044.mp4?t=1766651664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fatigue and rest. Party fatigue grows with every step, weakening your mystics in combat. Search for supplies and set up camps to reduce fatigue, heal, and recover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters &amp; Builds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Demonologist, the Exorcist, and the Witch unite to face the dangers of the Shrouded Lands - though each has their own reason for leaving humanity\u2019s last shelter.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/210284eccfd24d2e3532b60786427760.avif?t=1766651664\" width=620 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor. Although you control only three characters, the Armor-Skill system allows for diverse builds and flexible strategies. Each character can equip different armor, which defines their appearance and available skills - but their core stats are not affected by changing armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743600/extras/f5265735355ec59263ed829e9ac6386d.poster.avif?t=1766651664\" width=620 height=2