6651664"}],"short_description":"Lead the Witch, Exorcist and Demonologist across lands conquered by evil. Engage demons and their disciples in tactical combat. Shackle enemies\u2019 minds with Torments, restricting their combat actions. Slay the possessed, or exorcise to free their souls.","steam_appid":3743600,"support_info":{"email":"yuriymokryy@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Ukrainian","type":"game","website":null}